  "guidebook": {
    "intro": "Majina ya kazi ni majina ya watu, kwa hiyo huchukua **omu-** kwa mtu mmoja na **aba-** kwa wengi, kama Kiswahili m-/wa- (mkulima, wakulima). Mengi hutoka moja kwa moja kwenye kitenzi.",
    "phrases": [
      {
        "target": "Okola mulimu ki?",
        "base": "Unafanya kazi gani?"
      },
      {
        "target": "Ndi mulimi.",
        "base": "Mimi ni mkulima."
      },
      {
        "target": "Maama musuubuzi.",
        "base": "Mama ni mfanyabiashara."
      },
      {
        "target": "Nkola mu ofiisi.",
        "base": "Ninafanya kazi ofisini."
      },
      {
        "target": "Nkolera kampuni ennene.",
        "base": "Ninafanyia kazi kampuni kubwa."
      },
      {
        "target": "Nfuna omusaala buli mwezi.",
        "base": "Ninapata mshahara kila mwezi."
      }
    ],
    "tips": [
      {
        "id": "people-nouns",
        "title": "Kutoka kitenzi hadi kazi",
        "body": [
          "Weka **omu-** kwenye shina la kitenzi na ubadilishe **-a** ya mwisho kuwa **-i** upate mtu anayetenda, kama Kiswahili **-jenga → mjenzi**, **-pika → mpishi**: **-lima** (lima) inatoa **omulimi** (mkulima), **-zimba** (jenga) inatoa **omuzimbi** (mjenzi), **-fumba** (pika) inatoa **omufumbi** (mpishi).",
          "Kusema mtu ni nini, ondoa irabu ya kwanza: **Ndi mulimi** (mimi ni mkulima), **Ssali muvuzi** (Ssali ni dereva). Hakuna neno la “ni” kama la Kiswahili."
        ],
        "table": [
          [
            "Kitenzi",
            "Mtu mmoja",
            "Watu wengi"
          ],
          [
            "-lima (lima)",
            "omulimi",
            "abalimi"
          ],
          [
            "-zimba (jenga)",
